  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">MAHDARA VOCATIONAL TRAINING CENTER</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">THE CENTER WILL INCLUDE SIX FULLY EQUIPPED WORKSHOPS FOR CONDUCTING TRAINING IN CAR MECHANICS, ELECTRICITY, CARPENTRY, METAL WORKS, WELDING, BUILDING, SANITARY EQUIPMENT FIXING, PLUMBING, SECTRETARIAL AND CLERICAL SKILLS. IT WILL ALSO INCLUDE STAFF AND STUDENT&apos;S RESIDENCE WITH A CAPACITY OF 165 STUDENTS PER YEAR.</narrative>
  </description>
